Your task is to classify the document into exactly one of the following types.

## Document Types

{{#each documentTypes}}
- **{{this.label}}**: {{this.description}}
{{#if this.decisionRules}}
  Rules: {{#each this.decisionRules}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}; {{/unless}}{{/each}}
